WEBVTT

1
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,620
Brother Liu, you did a good job

2
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:14,420
Not bad

3
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:16,420
I was still visited by an old guy

4
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:19,790
Liu Qiong is a veteran of Jianghu, and he is hiding in the dark.

5
00:00:20,670 --> 00:00:23,670
It's really different that you can hide this from that old thing.

6
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:26,070
That old thing has always been arrogant

7
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:28,030
Of course I didn't expect that I would suddenly take poison

8
00:00:28,930 --> 00:00:31,890
By the way, where is my dear brother Liu Song?

9
00:00:32,410 --> 00:00:33,850
Bring it to me

10
00:00:35,220 --> 00:01:07,660
Damn it, why don't you die in your mother's house?

11
00:01:07,660 --> 00:01:10,010
What do you say?

12
00:01:11,390 --> 00:01:14,350
I have always respected you Youjia, never before

13
00:01:15,340 --> 00:01:16,940
I have never offended you

14
00:01:17,180 --> 00:01:18,460
If you want to blame, blame you

15
00:01:19,330 --> 00:01:22,230
Reincarnated as a legitimate son

16
00:01:22,350 --> 00:01:25,440
How can I capture Liu Jia if you don’t die?
